[engl]
{100}{}{Seth}
{200}{}{You see Seth, leader of the guards of Shady Sands.}

{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Armed}
{1020}{}{QUEST STATE: NOT STARTED}
{1030}{}{QUEST STATE: STARTED}
{1040}{}{QUEST STATE: FINISHED}

{2000}{}{You are carrying a weapon. Please holster it before entering Shady Sands.}
{2010}{}{[Holster weapon]}

{3000}{}{Good day. I am called Seth. How can I help you?}
{3010}{}{I'd like some information.}
{3020}{}{I heard you're having trouble with Radscorpions. I can help.}
{3030}{}{Nothing. Goodbye.}

{4000}{}{Have you dealt with those Radscorpions yet?}
{4010}{}{I'd like some information.}
{4020}{}{Not yet. I'm still dealing with them.}
{4030}{}{The Radscorpions are dead.}
{4040}{}{Nothing. Goodbye.}

{5000}{}{Thanks again for taking care of those Radscorpions.}
{5010}{}{I'd like some information.}
{5020}{}{Goodbye.}

{7000}{}{Information? What do you want to know about?}
{7010}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{7020}{}{I want to know about the raiders.}
{7030}{}{I want to know about this place.}
{7040}{}{Nothing else, thanks.}

{8000}{}{Those damn Radscorpions have been after our Brahmin since we moved here. Not a week goes by that someone doesn't get poisoned trying to keep them out of the pens. Last week they took my brother Jarvis. Razlo, our doctor, is looking for an antidote as quickly as he can. Hey, if you have the means to help us, why don't you talk to our leader, Aradesh.}
{8010}{}{I have another question.}
{8020}{}{Thanks. Goodbye.}

{9000}{}{There are several groups of raiders. I organize guards like Ian to help fight them off. There is one band to the southeast of here. Watch out for them.}
{9010}{}{I have another question.}
{9020}{}{Thanks. Goodbye.}

{10000}{}{Shady Sands is a peaceful community. We have our own irrigation system, so we can grow our own food. If we were not plagued with raiders and Radscorpions, we would have no problems.}
{10010}{}{I have another question.}
{10020}{}{Thanks. Goodbye.}

{11000}{}{Are you sure you want me to give you directions to the Radscorpion caves? I can't go, but I can show you the way.}
{11010}{}{Yes.}
{11020}{}{No.}

{12000}{}{Ok, just let me know when you are ready to go to the caves.}
{12010}{}{[Done]}

{13000}{}{We've got a serious problem with Radscorpions. They've been attacking our Brahmin and poisoning our people. If you're willing to help, I can show you where their caves are.}
{13010}{}{I'll take care of them.}

{14000}{}{Make sure you gear up properly before heading out. Let me know when they're dead.}
{14010}{}{Will do.}

{15000}{}{The Radscorpions are dead? Good. You've done Shady Sands a real service. Here's your reward.}
{15010}{}{Thank you.}
